  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till Zanzibars utbildningsministerium f&#xF6;r utveckling av Zanzibars strategiska plan f&#xF6;r undervisning, ZEDP, under tiden november 2007 tom. december 2008, d&#xE4;refter f&#xF6;rl&#xE4;ngt tom. juni 2010. St&#xF6;det framf&#xF6;rallt inriktat p&#xE5; kapacitetsutveckling och byggande av klassrum. Nytt avtal f&#xF6;r 2010 - 2013 har ing&#xE5;tts.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Ministry of Education and Vocational Training for development of a strategic plan for the education sector,ZEDP. The agreement is valid from November 2007 to December 2008, subsequently prolonged until June 2010. New agreement for 2010 - 2013 has been signed.</narrative>
